# Mobile keyboard configuration

## Estimates (`estimate-generator.jsx`)

- **Full step 1–7 keyboard contract** (step 8 accessories included in the same doc): see **`estimate-generator-keyboards-stable.mdc`** (same folder). Follow it before changing any `TextInput` / `AppTextField` keyboard or accessory on that screen.
- Step 1–2: **edit only the field the user asked about**; do not refactor neighbors to shared presets unless asked.

## SKU Search modal (`AttachSkuModal.tsx`)

- Use spreads from `mobile/constants/inputKeyboardPresets.ts` (`textInputPhonePadDoneAccessory`, `skuSearchQueryTextKeyboard`) for the ZIP and Search `TextInput`s. Adjust behavior in that file when the task is about those fields.

## Shared IDs

- Accessory native IDs live in `mobile/constants/keyboard.ts` (`KEYBOARD_ACCESSORY_IDS`, `iosAccessoryId`).

## Intent

Avoid drive-by keyboard changes: fixing one input must not rewrite unrelated fields the user already approved.
